{"meta":{"id":"cee:259512","type":"series","name":"Dororo to Hyakkimaru","poster":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/7BDF48EA-06CB-DAD5-B8E1-E7490A642169_poster.jpg","background":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/7BDF48EA-06CB-DAD5-B8E1-E7490A642169_poster.jpg","description":"A samurai lord has bartered away his newborn son's organs to forty-eight demons in exchange for dominance on the battlefield. Yet, the abandoned infant survives thanks to a medicine man who equips him with primitive prosthetics—lethal ones with which the wronged son will use to hunt down the multitude of demons to reclaim his body one piece at a time, before confronting his father. On his journeys the young hero encounters an orphan who claims to be the greatest thief in Japan.","releaseInfo":"2019","genres":["اكشن","مغامرة","رسوم متحركة","تاريخي","خارق"],"cast":["Suzuki Hiroki","Suzuki Rio"],"director":["Furuhashi Kazuhiro"],"imdbRating":"8.2","runtime":"24 min","videos":[{"id":"cee:259512","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 1","season":1,"episode":1,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/7BDF48EA-06CB-DAD5-B8E1-E7490A642169_poster.jpg","released":"2019-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:259513","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 2","season":1,"episode":2,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/96F12F79-26E1-73FF-D806-D4C1FAEC410D_poster.jpg","released":"2019-01-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:259514","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 3","season":1,"episode":3,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/96F12F79-26E1-73FF-D806-D4C1FAEC410D_poster.jpg","released":"2019-01-03T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:259515","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 4","season":1,"episode":4,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/96F12F79-26E1-73FF-D806-D4C1FAEC410D_poster.jpg","released":"2019-01-04T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:259516","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 5","season":1,"episode":5,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/96F12F79-26E1-73FF-D806